{'symbol': 'OGN', 'date': '2021-12-13 10:12:00', 'title': "ORGANON'S ACQUISITION OF KAROLINSKA DEVELOPMENT'S PORTFOLIO COMPANY FORENDO PHARMA HAS BEEN SUCCESSFULLY COMPLETED", 'text': "STOCKHOLM SWEDEN – DECEMBER 13, 2021. KAROLINSKA DEVELOPMENT AB (NASDAQ STOCKHOLM: KDEV) ANNOUNCES TODAY THAT THE PREVIOUSLY ANNOUNCED TRANSACTION, IN WHICH THE GLOBAL PHARMACEUTICAL COMPANY ORGANON & CO. (NYSE:OGN) ACQUIRES KAROLINSKA DEVELOPMENT'S PORTFOLIO COMPANY FORENDO PHARMA, HAS NOW BEEN COMPLETED. THIS IS ONE OF THE LARGEST COMMERCIAL DEALS IN THE NORDIC BIOTECH SECTOR IN 2021."}